### Base Settings
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/v1
@userId = user-demo-123
@notebookId = 1a901b82-4dc4-498e-a91a-df4aed471a9a
@sourceId = 8e49c3e2-ed7f-4c97-96f8-ce88066b8b84
@elementId = elem-demo-456
@conversationId = conv-demo-789

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 2. Create Notebook
POST {{baseUrl}}/notebooks
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quantum Physics & Machine Learning Research"
}

### 3. List User Notebooks (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notebooks
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 4. Upload Source Document (Idempotent with Idempotency-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/sources
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
Idempotency-Key: upload-key-001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_paper.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample_pdfs/sample_paper.pdf
--boundary--

### 5. List Sources in Notebook (ETag & Status Metadata)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/sources
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 6. Toggle Source Active State (Idempotent PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/sources/{{sourceId}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 7. Get Source Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/sources/{{sourceId}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 8. Get Page Metadata (PDF Points, Rotation, Pixel Size, BBoxes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources/{{sourceId}}/pages/1?dpi=150
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 9. Get Page Image (PNG with ETag and Cache-Control)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources/{{sourceId}}/pages/1/image?dpi=150
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 10. Get Element Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources/{{sourceId}}/elements/{{elementId}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 11. Synchronous Chat Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/chat
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the main findings in the quantum computing section?",
  "conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}",
  "relevance_threshold": 0.4
}

### 12. SSE Streaming Chat Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/chat/stream
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "query": "Summarize the key mathematical formulations.",
  "conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}",
  "relevance_threshold": 0.35
}

### 13. List Notebook Conversations (Cursor-Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/conversations?limit=10
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 14. Get Conversation Message History (Cursor-Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}?limit=20
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### 15. Delete Source (Cascades to Vectors, Crops, & Page Cache)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notebooks/{{notebookId}}/sources/{{sourceId}}
X-User-ID: {{userId}}
